{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61851180a6dc6fe4572a15cf996af258","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey everyone! I haven&#039;t found a thread about this venue and would like a place where future brides can come and share information. Anyone else considering Huracan because Jellyfish is booked or just because they like it?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Please share pricing information (I have some information about food\/drinks, but not decor or anything additional).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So far the only pictures of any weddings that I can find is here: http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/huracan-cafe-punta-cana-wedding-alexandra-tyler\/comment-page-1\/#comment-44586&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m considering making a fb page for it, let me know if anyone is interested!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1789136,"PostDate":1376012883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey everyone! I haven't found a thread about this venue and would like a place where future brides can come and share information. Anyone else considering Huracan because Jellyfish is booked or just because they like it?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Please share pricing information (I have some information about food\/drinks, but not decor or anything additional).\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So far the only pictures of any weddings that I can find is here: <a href='http:\/\/www.katyanovablog.com\/huracan-cafe-punta-cana-wedding-alexandra-tyler\/comment-page-1\/#comment-44586' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.katyanova...\/#comment-44586<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm considering making a fb page for it, let me know if anyone is interested!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"-S","Email":"xkittix@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.104.234.237","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1338921286,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256276.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":152,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shaeshae18","Id":256276,"Name":"shaeshae18","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f831d4299c337135d1cd35ce6b9b8ddf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Hello,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;There is not much about&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#373e68;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:calibri,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;\"&gt;Huracan Cafe wedding online. I only found the blog of Katya Nova (which you provided a link)- which looked beautiful. I was going to consider&amp;nbsp;Huracan Cafe but Jellyfish is available&amp;nbsp;in the month I wanted. &lt;\/span&