{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"181.37.87.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7d9f4537e5b2f23ca33fce0735275b4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hola,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone is interested in the Huracan Cafe as their wedding venue, I suggest you get in touch with Natalia &amp;amp; Mayte. They are the wedding planning &amp;amp; design team now at the Huracan and are AMAZING! Mayte &amp;amp; Nati are our dear friends and put so much heart into each and every wedding. Please get in touch with them. You can reach Mayte at&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica, Arial, &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\"&gt;mayteweddingdesignerpuntacana@[member=\"gmail\"].com.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica, Arial, &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\"&gt;&amp;amp; If you have any questions, please free to ask. Huracan is one of our favourite spots in Punta Cana.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica, Arial, &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\"&gt;Lastly... take a peek at this beauty. An amazing wedding at the Huracan done by Natalia + Mayte. ---&amp;gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/hard-rock-hotel-huracan-cafe-punta-cana-wedding-chanel-juan\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/hard-rock-hotel-huracan-cafe-punta-cana-wedding-chanel-juan\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;XOXO - Mel&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855779,"PostDate":1403040908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hola,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone is interested in the Huracan Cafe as their wedding venue, I suggest you get in touch with Natalia & Mayte. They are the wedding planning & design team now at the Huracan and are AMAZING! Mayte & Nati are our dear friends and put so much heart into each and every wedding. Please get in touch with them. You can reach Mayte at\u00a0<span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><u><strong><span  style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica, Arial,'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\">mayteweddingdesignerpuntacana@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com.<\/span><\/strong><\/u><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica, Arial,'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\">& If you have any questions, please free to ask. Huracan is one of our favourite spots in Punta Cana.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(62,69,76);font-family:Helvetica, Arial,'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);\">Lastly... take a peek at this beauty. An amazing wedding at the Huracan done by Natalia + Mayte. ---> <\/span><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/hard-rock-hotel-huracan-cafe-punta-cana-wedding-chanel-juan\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.shoeboxph...ng-chanel-juan\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>XOXO - Mel<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<div><img src=\"https:\/\/lh6.googleusercontent.com\/-lGVqCU0N1AM\/U8QTGSsNQLI\/AAAAAAAAAG8\/c2eMfpfUb98\/w900-h34-no\/Separator.png\" alt=\"Separator.png\"><\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.shoebox.photography'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh4.googleusercontent.com\/-JdsF2YCETJ4\/U8QTHoSz6AI\/AAAAAAAAAHI\/Gs0gmfxN6yg\/w900-h208-no\/Signature+Image.png\" alt=\"Signature+Image.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.shoeboxphotography.ca\/blog\/'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\/-rTlCZicS2NI\/U8QTLPp1YfI\/AAAAAAAAAHw\/Qvck2GcSFVU\/s32-no\/Blog.png\" alt=\"Blog.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ShoeBoxPhotography.ca'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh4.googleusercontent.com\/-uxRk32WMQoc\/U8QTLKwy4DI\/AAAAAAAAAH4\/pRWW6OhEkKM\/s32-no\/Facebook.png\" alt=\"Facebook.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/plus.google.com\/+ShoeBoxPhotographyCoquitlam'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh5.googleusercontent.com\/-TMGooLPDMy4\/U8QTLLPlm0I\/AAAAAAAAAHs\/w6eJlxhiJAU\/s32-no\/Google%252B.png\" alt=\"Google%252B.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/instagram.com\/shoeboxphoto'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\/-ajJLgsJxa04\/U8QTLbzmXVI\/AAAAAAAAAHo\/NrvofXeyI7Q\/s32-no\/Instagram.png\" alt=\"Instagram.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/sbxphotography'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh5.googleusercontent.com\/-vJoZFBKe3io\/U8QTLmkl-RI\/AAAAAAAAAHg\/WIjIkkyfuP8\/s32-no\/Pinterest.png\" alt=\"Pinterest.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.twitter.com\/ShoeBox_Photo'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh5.googleusercontent.com\/-7rLyHZHERXc\/U8QTL3MkRzI\/AAAAAAAAAHk\/L-CoCkcA8rw\/s32-no\/Twitter.png\" alt=\"Twitter.png\"><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:hello@shoebox.photography?subject=BDW%20Message'><img src=\"https:\/\/lh4.googleusercontent.com\/-hOjdlMEtFy4\/U8QTGcV0rrI\/AAAAAAAAAHA\/_nX5zB9A7z0\/w264-h43-no\/Let%2527s+Chat+arrow+and+button.png\" alt=\"Let%2527s+Chat+arrow+and+button.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"hello@shoebox.photography","IpAddress":"181.37.93.247","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1401807998,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278221.png?_r=1402507848","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ShoeBoxPhotography","Id":278221,"Name":"ShoeBoxPhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.104.2.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"623b347f06a118f02cb8825e782d67eb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi can someone send me a pricing list? I would greatly appreciate it!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;audreystiles@hotmail.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857296,"PostDate":1404003437,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi can someone send me a pricing list? I would greatly appreciate it!!<\/p>\n<p>audreystiles@hotmail.com<\/p>\n<p>thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"audreystiles@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"97.104.2.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404003207,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278739.jpg?_r=1404663391","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Augabooky","Id":278739,"Name":"Augabooky","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.116.25.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91dc12dd34e8a6e411f3f99b38a58be1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yes please send me pricing as well. I am interested, I&#039;m getting married December 22, 2014 &amp;amp; would like to see if they have availability for that day. Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857512,"PostDate":1404100887,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yes please send me pricing as well. I am interested, I'm getting married December 22, 2014 & would like to see if they have availability for that day. Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gisellelewis88@gmail.com","IpAddress":"23.116.25.30","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404100594,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"drbride2014","Id":278752,"Name":"drbride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.2.28.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0a3610b08dc5ed83bd25e0837648e82","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Would you please send me pricing as well. I&#039;m getting married in March 2015 and I&#039;m trying to find a venue. Thanks&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;jenw1002@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864180,"PostDate":1407023443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Would you please send me pricing as well. I'm getting married in March 2015 and I'm trying to find a venue. Thanks<\/p>\n<p>jenw1002@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenw1002@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.2.28.48","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407023260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jenw1002","Id":279273,"Name":"jenw1002","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.73.157.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6daae5471e99e171901dedcd59599df","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Can someone send me pricing as well? Getting married 2016... thanks :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;nikita_grai@hotmail.com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867906,"PostDate":1408585551,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Can someone send me pricing as well? Getting married 2016... thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>nikita_grai@hotmail.com<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nikita_grai@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.0.174.203","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1274954677,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228609.jpg?_r=1401154267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NikitaGrai","Id":228609,"Name":"NikitaGrai","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.161.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"180a2a3241d30c7972dbe44b1ef8054d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I would like the info too Shamicaglover@yahoo.com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867992,"PostDate":1408633788,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I would like the info too Shamicaglover@yahoo.com<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=UBB&utm_campaign=tickers\"><img src=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt1c2490.aspx\" alt=\"tt1c2490.aspx\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394136776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.77.6.53","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c3129e57d11634178b9b00baeaed16f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I got married here August 8 2014. The best decision ever. &amp;nbsp;I was a Jellyfish bride up until I found out that Mayte was no longer with the Jellyfish venue. I was in a complete panic mode. However, I did reach out to Mayte and she updated me on what was going on. I did hesitate at first, but realized that Mayte was the reason I chose Jellyfish. What she does with the place is phenomenal. She has a true passion for what she does and it shows within her work. She made the transition for my fianc\u00e9 and I with no problem. I skyped with Mayte, spoke on the phone and wrote numerous of emails. She always made time for me. I showed her what I liked through photos and left the rest up to her. I felt completely confident in Mayte and I was not worried after having spoken to her. Once I met her I was in love with the place and Mayte. I even met Natalia. They both are beautiful ladies so sweet and devoted. I couldn&#039;t have asked for better or more qualified wedding coordinators. The day of my wedding we arrived bright and early for hair and makeup with Anna Nuet (who is amazing as well). Mayte took care of us all morning and afternoon and right into the wedding. The food at Huracan is absolutely delicious. The drinks were very good, some strong ones for our big drinkers and soft drinks for the guest who don&#039;t drink much. Everyone raved about the BIG JEROME. They continue to talk about the food and drinks. The want my husband and I to have our 1 yr Anniversary there again. Not bad idea at all lol. The decor.......took my breath away. I was so stunned with how well put the colors and every detail was put together. It was way better then i imagined it for myself. I could not believe it was all for me. Mayte and Natalia 100% made the perfect wedding my dream wedding happen. I completely recommend Huracan or at least Mayte and Natalia for your dream wedding. They make it very personal and do it for the love of the job! I love those ladies. I am posting my gallery for all to see.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.hdcphoto.com\/customer-area\/shirleyandjerome\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.hdcphoto.com\/customer-area\/shirleyandjerome\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871409,"PostDate":1410407416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I got married here August 8 2014. The best decision ever. \u00a0I was a Jellyfish bride up until I found out that Mayte was no longer with the Jellyfish venue. I was in a complete panic mode. However, I did reach out to Mayte and she updated me on what was going on. I did hesitate at first, but realized that Mayte was the reason I chose Jellyfish. What she does with the place is phenomenal. She has a true passion for what she does and it shows within her work. She made the transition for my fianc\u00e9 and I with no problem. I skyped with Mayte, spoke on the phone and wrote numerous of emails. She always made time for me. I showed her what I liked through photos and left the rest up to her. I felt completely confident in Mayte and I was not worried after having spoken to her. Once I met her I was in love with the place and Mayte. I even met Natalia. They both are beautiful ladies so sweet and devoted. I couldn't have asked for better or more qualified wedding coordinators. The day of my wedding we arrived bright and early for hair and makeup with Anna Nuet (who is amazing as well). Mayte took care of us all morning and afternoon and right into the wedding. The food at Huracan is absolutely delicious. The drinks were very good, some strong ones for our big drinkers and soft drinks for the guest who don't drink much. Everyone raved about the BIG JEROME. They continue to talk about the food and drinks. The want my husband and I to have our 1 yr Anniversary there again. Not bad idea at all lol. The decor.......took my breath away. I was so stunned with how well put the colors and every detail was put together. It was way better then i imagined it for myself. I could not believe it was all for me. Mayte and Natalia 100% made the perfect wedding my dream wedding happen. I completely recommend Huracan or at least Mayte and Natalia for your dream wedding. They make it very personal and do it for the love of the job! I love those ladies. I am posting my gallery for all to see.<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.hdcphoto.com\/customer-area\/shirleyandjerome\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.hdcphoto....irleyandjerome\/<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"svazquez309@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.29.64.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365969748,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Slaughter2be","Id":268563,"Name":"Slaughter2be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.173.33.31","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b05174bfa405ffdba8f006d000e9032e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I would love some pricing info if anyone has it please &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:britt_k5@Hotmail.com&#039;&gt;britt_k5@Hotmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;. Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872051,"PostDate":1410964000,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I would love some pricing info if anyone has it please <a href='mailto:britt_k5@Hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>britt_k5@Hotmail.com<\/a>. Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britt_k5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.173.33.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410961928,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jengak5","Id":279872,"Name":"jengak5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.120.210.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cac0dd936f662b904b1049a860bfa6f2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Feel free to reach out directly to Mayte for pricing information. She is extremely friendly and quick to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Planning on getting married June 13, 2015 at Huracan Cafe. I chose this venue mainly because everyone spoke so highly of Mayte.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For those choosing Huracan Cafe, can you share where you and your guests will be staying? A lot of people recommend NOW Larimar, but looking at the pictures it just doesn&#039;t impress me.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873543,"PostDate":1411838547,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Feel free to reach out directly to Mayte for pricing information. She is extremely friendly and quick to respond.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning on getting married June 13, 2015 at Huracan Cafe. I chose this venue mainly because everyone spoke so highly of Mayte.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For those choosing Huracan Cafe, can you share where you and your guests will be staying? A lot of people recommend NOW Larimar, but looking at the pictures it just doesn't impress me.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nidiasamuelwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.29.205.56","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405575239,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279047.jpg?oh=6c8c682791b9232549e5438d3af163e0&oe=54b683d0&__gda__=1420762885_bd00e16873f585983bc6151a58c0cbfa","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"ndiamar","Id":279047,"Name":"ndiamar","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.254.151.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45131bb641d0a71486cf2769b9855b70","RawContent":"I&#039;m not sure about all of the pricing, but on their website they have a wedding guide if anyone would like a basic idea!!\nNever mind, their website is down now, I swear I looked at it a few days ago.","Attachments":[],"Id":1873578,"PostDate":1411876460,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm not sure about all of the pricing, but on their website they have a wedding guide if anyone would like a basic idea!!<br \/>Never mind, their website is down now, I swear I looked at it a few days ago.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alwalters625@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.243.246.55","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405994695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-c