a pricing list for Huracan cafe?  Thanks \n\nButter_shortcake@hotmail.com","Attachments":[],"Id":1889286,"PostDate":1426403688,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi <br><br>\nCan someone send me a pricing list for Huracan cafe?  Thanks <br>\nButter_shortcake@hotmail.com\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"diana_zhang05@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"174.116.175.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421253356,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Dzhang","Id":281722,"Name":"Dzhang","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.226.128.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a8f44d8e5c03debdd668f805e35141c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can someone email me info as well? Jenn.Terrone@[member=\"gmail\"].com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am considering this place for my wedding in April 2016&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!!!!!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jenn&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894964,"PostDate":1430427373,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                