"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Has anyone else had difficulty trying to get a hold of someone from the Huracan cafe? \u00a0I am trying to get information and have had no luck.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nesabay@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"73.179.7.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437095131,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nesabay","Id":283996,"Name":"nesabay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.45.141.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1441386073,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7d0fc189b383e03525f88f0ceabd6f1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey everyone I am trying to get info on Huracan Cafe. If anyone has any info can you please forward it to me... Annelissep@aol.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Dzhang\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JennMarie\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"nesabay\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"demika\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jacquisuarez\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jacquisuarez\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"nesabay\"]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904164,"PostDate":1441386052,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey everyone I am trying to get info on Huracan Cafe. If anyone has any info can you please forward it to me... Annelissep@aol.com<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281722\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281722-dzhang\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Dzhang<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282815\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282815-jennmarie\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JennMarie<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283996\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283996-nesabay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nesabay<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282084\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282084-demika\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">demika<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281953\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281953-jacquisuarez\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jacquisuarez<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281953\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281953-jacquisuarez\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jacquisuarez<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283996\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283996-nesabay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nesabay<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pannelisse@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.45.141.241","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440624597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284576.jpg?_r=1442490456","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beJara","Id":284576,"Name":"Soon2beJara","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"140.163.254.149","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5266865b4f3e3e7dabd88b3fe62b8707","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies, I am getting married at HC. I have all the contact info if you would like it but I would highly suggest checking out the Huracan Cafe Mayte Mari FB page and especially the Punta Cana Brides FB page. Super helpful for me during this entire process!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Loads of pictures and a wealth of information from past brides!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904272,"PostDate":1441631974,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies, I am getting married at HC. I have all the contact info if you would like it but I would highly suggest checking out the Huracan Cafe Mayte Mari FB page and especially the Punta Cana Brides FB page. Super helpful for me during this entire process!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Loads of pictures and a wealth of information from past brides!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roanddaniel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"140.163.254.149","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441631878,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"danro","Id":284713,"Name":"danro","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.157.47.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ffa21669d47dd2d56c50f769af6344a7","RawContent":"Hi everyone! I am also looking at the Huracan Cafe for my destination wedding next year. I&#039;ve tried to contact the restaurant and Mayte (wedding planner\/decorator for the Huracan) via email and have not heard back :( If anyone has the price lists or any contact info they can send, it would be much appreciated. Thanks!\n\n\njadejohnson1215@[member=\"gmail\"].com","Attachments":[],"Id":1904571,"PostDate":1442071004,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone! I am also looking at the Huracan Cafe for my destination wedding next year. I've tried to contact the restaurant and Mayte (wedding planner\/decorator for the Huracan) via email and have not heard back <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> If anyone has the price lists or any contact info they can send, it would be much appreciated. Thanks!<br><br>\njadejohnson1215@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jadejohnson1215@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.157.47.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442069427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284788.jpg?_r=1442066841","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jade1215","Id":284788,"Name":"Jade1215","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"140.241.0.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74806,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98bba8891dcba1763b0443ee56165775","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Pao1\" post=\"1848096\" timestamp=\"1399129624\"]\n[font=&#039;comic sans ms&#039;]Hi Ladies, [\/font]\n\n[font=&#039;comic sans ms&#039;]if anybody needs the info I have it, I am doing my reception there October 2014. Just let me know and I will email it. [\/font][\/quote]Hi Pao1,\nI&#039;d love to get the information you received. I&#039;m still waiting for a response from the cafe.\n\nThank you so much in advance!","Attachments":[],"Id":1904866,"PostDate":1442425901,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Pao1, on 03 May 2014 - 08:07 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Hi Ladies, <\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">if anybody needs the info I have it, I am doing my reception there October 2014. Just let me know and I will email it. <\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Pao1,<\/p>\n<p>I'd love to get the information you received. I'm still waiting for a response from the cafe.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much in advance!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"femarte@gmail.com","IpAddress":"140.241.0.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442420860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Purpleflower","Id":284837,"Name":"Purpleflower","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":39,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
