{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":116207,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"karleealyssa,\n\nstreelbride has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"GSP Wedding!!\".\n\nstreelbride said:\n======================================================================\nHey congrats to you too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \nI think the ballpark amount for the chillout reception is $100 a person with a 40 person minimum. You can have less than 40 people but you'd still have to pay for 40.\n \nI can send what the wedding coordinator sent to me. The info for that will be in the private parties document.\n \nWe are having our ceremony at 4:00 at the Riviera Gazebo and then we're just eating on the buffet since I have a lot of food allergies and children (8) at the wedding. It will just be easier than doing  a set menu at a restaurant which was our original plan <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/> since you only get one selection for the menus there.\nI'm having a beach cocktail reception with a dj from 8-11 possibly with some hor's d'oeuves.\n \nHave you booked your trips yet? Our prices were a bit high since we are going during spring break <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> My fiance is a teacher and that's the only time other than summer that we could do it.\n \nI will email you the info from the resort shortly,\n \nhappy planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\nSarah\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11406&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":283685,"Name":"streelbride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283685.jpg?_r=1437401496","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442052088,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11406}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"1","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
